{"unit_id":"AllShadowAnan__dsh-context-compressor#caveat-1","repo":"AllShadowAnan/dsh-context-compressor","commit":"e1944e943dc3afd3f8829da081dbd55d29c0b284","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-context-compressor 使用窗口比例模式时，若会话还没有记录模型上下文窗口，该步不会触发压缩。见 lib/index.js:341-354。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:341-354"]}
